.Dd October 17, 2026
.Dt PATINA-WALLPAPER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm patina-wallpaper
.Nd the Patina desktop's wallpaper
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl h | V
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
draws the wallpaper behind every window, on every screen: the image named
by
.Ic wallpaper
in the bar's config, laid on the screen as
.Ic wallpaper_fit
says, or without one the Sector F Labs flask and name in the colours of the
bar's skin.
It watches the config, and redraws when the wallpaper, its fit or the skin
change.
.Pp
Clicks pass through it to the compositor, which opens
.Xr patina-menu 1
on a right click.
.Pp
.Xr patina-compositor 1
starts it first, before the bar, and starts it again whenever it exits.
The wallpaper is chosen in
.Xr patina-settings 1 ,
from
.Pa ~/Pictures/Wallpapers
and the system's backgrounds.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , -help
Print a short usage message.
.It Fl V , -version
Print the version.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa ~/.config/patina-hud/config.toml
.Ic wallpaper ,
an image file or empty for the default;
.Ic wallpaper_fit ,
how it meets the screen:
.Cm fill
(the default) covers it, cropping the image's edges,
.Cm fit
shows all of the image with the skin's colour either side, and
.Cm centre
puts it at its own size in the middle, cropped if it's bigger;
and
.Ic skin .
There's no stretching.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr patina-hud 1 ,
.Xr patina-settings 1 ,
.Xr patina-desktop 7
